Z||000000||fieroshop||04-10-2000||11:24 PM||||Well I called my supplier to order factory quarter windows or my 88 GT and they do not have them and they are no longer available. I needed just one because I did not want to replace both with aftermarket windows. But I guess I am going to have to do just that. I carry the aftermarket windows and they look exceptionnaly good, but put them next to a factory unit and you can tell the slight differences. The factory units are tinted and the after market are not which is the biggest difference between the two. OH WELL! I guess that is live in the fast lane.||||reg||8
