Z||000002||tgowens||04-20-2000||03:05 PM||||Jeff, I put a set on my '87 GT (mine were all heat cracked) and they really look good!! there are some minor differences (tinting, curve of the leading edge, dot pattern but believe me, they are so slight only an expert (or a show judge) would notice -- let's face it, they look better than the cracked ones. And, you can get them from George at Fieroshop less than anywhere else I have found!!||||reg||10
